      "description": "CPU requests that moved since the last day this ran, biggest increase first. Re-running the ingest on a day it has already run does not shorten the comparison: it still reaches back to the previous day with data, which on the weekly schedule means the week before.\n\nMoves under 0.05 cores are left out as noise. An empty table means nothing changed by more than that, not that the panel is broken.",
